{"user": "Wait, if I play a7 instead, doesn't White get an even bigger comeback with a3 (looked like 7 discs flipped) since a6/a7 area opens up? Compared to g2 where White's a3 reply only flips 5. Which is actually safer?", "user_ts": "2026-08-12T20:28:25.373369+00:00", "assistant": "**a7 is safer.**\n\nYour count on **White a3** is right: after **a7**, White can flip a lot with **a3**. But that move also leaves Black the **a1 corner** available afterward, which is permanent and helps finish the edge.\n\nWith **g2**, the bigger trap is not White\u2019s **a3** reply \u2014 it\u2019s **White h1**, taking the corner you can\u2019t ever flip back. So even if **g2** wins more discs immediately, it gives White the more dangerous finish.", "assistant_started_ts": "2026-08-12T20:28:25.373369+00:00", "assistant_ts": "2026-08-12T20:28:30.373369+00:00", "annotation_user": {"final": ["Think Aloud", "Common Ground Question"], "consensus": ["Think Aloud", "Common Ground Question"], "votes": {"Think Aloud": 2, "Common Ground Question": 3}, "confidence": {"Think Aloud": 0.6666666666666666, "Common Ground Question": 1.0}, "per_model": {"llama": ["Think Aloud", "Common Ground Question"], "gpt": ["Common Ground Question"], "sonnet": ["Think Aloud", "Common Ground Question"]}, "n_valid": 3, "min_votes": 2, "no_majority": false, "needs_review": false, "arbiter_used": false}, "annotation_assistant_fine": {"final": ["Move Verdict", "Local Justification", "Worked Line", "Neutral Feedback"], "consensus": ["Move Verdict", "Local Justification", "Worked Line", "Neutral Feedback"], "votes": {"Move Verdict": 3, "Local Justification": 3, "Worked Line": 3, "Paraphrase": 1, "Neutral Feedback": 2, "General Principle": 1, "Positive Feedback": 1}, "confidence": {"Move Verdict": 1.0, "Local Justification": 1.0, "Worked Line": 1.0, "Paraphrase": 0.3333333333333333, "Neutral Feedback": 0.6666666666666666, "General Principle": 0.3333333333333333, "Positive Feedback": 0.3333333333333333}, "per_model": {"g